5189_4915271146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ktJEoD3HTZgQ7kNvwFZO4uL&_nc_oc=Adpwv4Cjq8udMSYYTV6y4tXgVR41h7AozRPKHtnanmd1VV2FQ8g_Iv1fK8mdzFeqFCs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHZxLBp9MWV6iJLHjIoDNWYPkrcYQbL6TDrGCC1vsVXHw&oe=6A7DC239"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zB7SV0l1Y2gQ7kNvwHfOg17&_nc_oc=Adp43hiME-mrMgF-EDwzpNS1n1UaleHxin29-yMN6ACqfhFsPO4N28lyLMuaP7WEVHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEkdg4td3J1WvpN2V_--06RACoY9GIEL8p56LXsMF03tw&oe=6A7D9CD3"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fmFfMnv91gwQ7kNvwFY0icd&_nc_oc=Adpif6M0OhKGl4-M-VkTWgkMb3js9rUe3TFyddAshJgJeULfh9w-squABwsZsB-M-aM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQETdLwVxRmn-L4lEu2_U2wxJBLj835eW1FMlt_9dM7R-Q&oe=6A7D9B1A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_u